 R←Test_ListFiles2_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;path
⍝ Test the `ListFiles2` method on a directory we have no read access to
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If 'Win'≢APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
     R←T._WindowsOnly
 :Else
     path←(WinSys.ExpandEnv'%SYSTEMROOT%'),'\system32\'
     list←##.FilesAndDirs.ListFiles2 path
     →T.PassesIf 0=+/∨/¨'/Configuration$'∘⍷list  ⍝ Because we have no access right to this folder, therefore we cannot see any of its content

     R←T._OK
 :EndIf
